  "text": "### 3.3 Audit Standards  \nInternal Audit follows:\n- **International Standards for the Professional Practice of Internal Auditing (ISPPIA)**\n- **IIA Code of Ethics** (Integrity, Objectivity, Confidentiality, Competency)\n- **FCA and PRA Expectations** for internal audit function\n- **FirstUK Bank Audit Charter** (this document)  \n---",
